WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.550
The opening light confirm connects beside the wall.

2
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:01.950
Charged OD Kikoken hits the cornered opponent.

3
00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:02.750
Back medium punch catches opponent after the projectile.

4
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.950
OD Spinning Bird Kick lifts opponent into the juggle.

5
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:05.150
Light Hyakuretsukyaku continues the corner juggle.

6
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.150
Heavy Tensho Kicks adds the final rising hits.

7
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:07.600
opponent recovers beside the corner.
